    {
      "id": "116:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27622:27624"
    },
    {
      "id": "116:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你住在附近吗？”你问道。他摇了摇头。“你车抛锚了或者遇到别的困难吗？”他又摇了摇头。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27624:27669"
    },
    {
      "id": "116:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你开始心慌。这家伙实在是太奇怪了。“那我恐怕帮不到你。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27669:27699"
    },
    {
      "id": "116:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你可以的。”他说。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27699:27711"
    },
    {
      "id": "116:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“怎么帮到你？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27711:27721"
    },
    {
      "id": "116:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你可以告诉我茱莉在哪。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27721:27736"
    },
    {
      "id": "116:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要询问他是怎么认得马克和茱莉的，转到 132。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27736:27761"
    },
    {
      "id": "116:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要让他离开，转到 117。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27761:27776"
    }
  ]
}
